From: mscharged native port
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the Wii32 frontend result-stream cue case on LP64
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

The original int cast becomes unsigned long modulo 32 bits on Wii.
Convert that authored hash through unsigned int on the native target before
the unsigned-long switch conversion. Keep the original console expression
and every cue, selector, branch and state operation unchanged.

diff --git a/src/Game/FE/feMusic.cpp b/src/Game/FE/feMusic.cpp
index 600657a..cb6c39d 100644
--- a/src/Game/FE/feMusic.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/FE/feMusic.cpp
@@ -30,7 +30,11 @@ bool FEMusic::IsPlayingCupResultStream()
 {
     switch (FEMusic::mCurrentMusicCue)
     {
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
+    case (unsigned int)0xAE597F5E:
+#else
     case (int)0xAE597F5E:
+#endif
     case 0x2341D569:
     case 0x2447F290:
     case 0x244A44AE:
